---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
---
<div class="cup reveal">
  <span class="cup-icon"><Icon name="trophy" size={32} /></span>
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Grassroots sport</p>
    <h3>The Anyichuks Unity Cup</h3>
    <p>Born of Dr. Odii’s passion for football, the Anyichuks Unity Cup is a yearly grassroots tournament in his hometown, Isu. It encourages and empowers young people and promotes sport at the grassroots, and has become something the community looks forward to every year.</p>
  </div>
</div>
